OL,3,GNEWSACall to create more safe havens in
OL,4,Aisland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore Jersey businesses, charities and
OL,7,Fcommunity groups are being urged to
OL,8,Fsign up to a scheme that offers support
OL,9,Fto people who feel vulnerable,
OL,10,Fdistressed or unsafe.
OL,12,FBusier streets, darker evenings and
OL,13,Fcrowded town centres during the festive
OL,14,Fseason could leave some islanders in
OL,15,Fneed of help, the Government of Jersey
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FThe Safe Places Network provides 19
OL,19,Fdesignated locations where people can
OL,20,Fgo if they feel lost, unwell,
OL,21,Foverwhelmed, isolated or at risk.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
