OL,3,GNEWSACall to create more safe havens in
OL,4,Aisland
OL,5,
OL,6,FParticipating venues include cafes,
OL,7,Fbanks, shops, parish halls and sports
OL,8,Fclubs, with trained staff able to offer
OL,9,Fsupport, contact friends or family, or
OL,10,Fhelp people access emergency
OL,11,Fassistance.
